TI  - Technology-Mediated Non-pharmacological Interventions for Dementia: Needs for and Challenges in Professional, Personalized and Multi-Stakeholder Collaborative Interventions
AU  - Sun, Yuling
AU  - Yi, Zhennan
AU  - Ma, Xiaojuan
AU  - Mao, Junyan
